{
  "title": "Talking Short 1: the one problem isn't the reactor (Script C)",
  "lines": [
    {"id": "l1", "text": "Everyone says the one problem | stopping a real Iron Man suit | is the arc reactor."},
    {"id": "l2", "text": "I ran the numbers. | It's not."},
    {"id": "l3", "text": "The real problem is hovering. | Hovering means pushing your whole weight | down through the air, every second."},
    {"id": "l4", "text": "My suit burns about five kilograms | of fuel a minute doing that. | Flying forward on a wing | burns less than one. | That's five times less."},
    {"id": "l5", "text": "So the fix isn't | a better power source. It's wings. | They swing back for speed, | open wide to turn, | and tilt up to brake."},
    {"id": "l6", "text": "With wings, the same suit flies | for about an hour | when launched like a glider. | The reactor can wait."},
    {"id": "l7", "text": "Follow, and I'll show | you the test."}
  ],
